# A triggered ability exists independently of its source once it is on the stack (CR 113.7a; ruling: the ability still
# resolves if Planar Void leaves). Lightning Bolt goes to the graveyard and the Void triggers; in response Bot1 destroys
# its own Void with Disenchant. Disenchant resolves first and the Void reaches the graveyard (nobody is left to exile
# it), Disenchant follows it (no Void, no trigger), and then the Void's trigger resolves anyway and exiles the Bolt.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Planar Void
Lightning Bolt
Disenchant
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

